[44.414001, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m\u001b[2m  CAMERA [w]\u001b[0m              \u001b[2m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1m\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\u001b[2m08:45:39\u001b[0m \u001b[37mINFO    \u001b[0m Press [s] for sensor calibration (gyro / accel / level / compass / baro)                                                                                      \u001b[1m\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\u001b[K\r\n"]
[44.414063, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m\u001b[2m  RC INPUT [r]\u001b[0m            \u001b[2m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1m\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\u001b[2m08:45:39\u001b[0m \u001b[37mINFO    \u001b[0m On the map, [i] saves a pinned satellite image to ./px4_maps                                                                                                  \u001b[1m\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\u001b[K\r\n"]
